  "summary_zh": "MKP 是东莞博可威电子科技有限公司（BKW）的PCB用DC-Link电容器（行业型号 C3D），引用标准 IEC 61071（GB/T 17702），额定电压 V_R（70℃）450~1300Vdc，对应 85℃ 降额工作电压 V_op 450~1100Vdc，工作温度范围 -40℃~+105℃，引脚间距 27.5mm / 37.5mm，预期寿命 100000h（U_N，θhs=70℃）；用于变频器、工业和高端电源、太阳能逆变器等高性能直流滤波。",
  "summary_en": "BKW MKP: DC-Link Capacitor for PCB (industry code C3D). Reference standard IEC 61071 (GB/T 17702), rated voltage V_R 450–1300Vdc at 70℃, derated to operating voltage V_op 450–1100Vdc at 85℃, operating temperature -40℃ to +105℃, lead spacing 27.5 / 37.5 mm, expected lifetime 100000 h (U_N, θhs=70℃); for high-performance DC filtering in drives, industrial and high-end power supplies and solar inverters.",
  "applications": [
    {
      "zh": "高性能直流滤波应用场合(如：变频器、工业和高端电源、太阳能逆变器等)",
